{
  "about": "Latched finishes for tab marks (Workspace `reached`, ui_model::tabbar::reached, core-protocol.md 'Tab bar'). Each case is a sequence of steps applied to a fresh workspace cache: `load` (a snapshot) or `event` (an event record); `expect` is the latched finish per resource id afterwards. Finishes come from what the cache observed (an event or an adopted snapshot against the cached record), never from first sight. Generated by the Rust model (tests/client_conformance.rs, VQRO_FIXTURE_UPDATE=1) and reviewed.",
